# Qt Notepad Application (C++)

A simple Notepad desktop application built using **C++ and Qt Widgets**.  
This project demonstrates file handling, GUI development, and the use of Qt dialogs in a desktop application.

## Features
- Create new text files  
- Open existing text files  
- Save and Save As functionality  
- Confirmation dialog for unsaved changes  
- Simple and clean user interface  
- Cross-platform (Windows / Linux)

## Screenshots
![screenshot of notepad app](https://github.com/Hardik7219/Qt-Notepad-Application--Cpp/blob/master/Screenshot_20251221_223334.png)

## Technologies Used
- C++
- Qt Framework (Qt Widgets)
- QFile and QTextStream
- QMessageBox and QFileDialog
- Qt Resource System (.qrc)

## How to Run
1. Clone the repository
2. Open the project in **Qt Creator**
3. Build the project
4. Run the application

